 (text "Drive board connector, power button, level shifting" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "01ff0134-e572-5a32-9aba-9d84a54cac99"))
(text "Pin map from boards/stack/stack.py (shared with the drive board). The header sits on the bottom side." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "d8efa3af-8c9a-5fbf-83b0-22bd5dfd524e"))
(text "Mating post about 14 mm below the insulator for the 20 mm gap into the SSQ-120-03 socket (3.7-6.4 mm insertion)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "65dcecbb-579f-5618-b383-e19e1929155b"))
(text "Power button: STK_PWR_BTN_N low turns on the P-FET, which drives PWR_SOFT (Antmicro Q7: a button press," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "8c5fd8f1-1e37-56fa-8cb4-8cd3ca362363"))
(text "powers the module on) and pulls SLEEP/WAKE* low through Q1004 (the OS sees a power-key event and shuts down)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "ea0ab1f8-70ca-5252-913f-18e3260eadf8"))
(text "STK_OS_HALTED: open drain, low while POWER_EN is high (module on). The drive board pulls it up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7514ef90-d81e-5541-a2f8-579d207177f4"))
(text "STM32 reset: the Jetson sets the expander bit MCU_RST_REQ (old CSIA_PEN), Q1003 pulls NRST low (open drain," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "4777ecb4-1e9f-5917-ba50-12c92b5e2c39"))
(text "so the STM32 can still reset itself). BOOT0, LIDAR_EN are expander outputs; ESTOP_OK, CHG_STAT inputs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "b514a909-a26a-52eb-840f-1962311ef9a9"))
(text "UART1 (1.8 V on the module) to the STM32 at 3.3 V through an NTS0102 powered from the drive board 3.3 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "a83512bf-4eda-585b-a174-eb097cf3d197"))
